#: uMain.pas rsWarnRHigh
msgid "Ein Zeitwiderstand über 1 MΩ: der Leckstrom des Elkos verfälscht die Zeit, lieber C grösser wählen"
msgstr "A timing resistor over 1 MΩ: the leakage current of the electrolytic capacitor distorts the timing, better choose a larger C"

#: uMain.pas rsChipFast
msgid "über 50 Hz"
msgstr "over 50 Hz"

#: uMain.pas rsWarnFast
